{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venus is a sandbox action-adventure that merges RPG progression with creative engineering, physics-based construction, and high-stakes exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the planet\u2019s dual nature\u2014a breathtaking, cloud-covered sky contrasted with its harsh and unforgiving surface\u2014the game delivers a rich, multi-layered experience. Venus invites you to design and construct innovative vehicles for mining and exploration, help shape a utopian city floating above the storm, and wield cutting-edge weaponry to face the relentless machine threat lurking below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits, no rules\u2014just pure creativity! In Creative Mode, you have access to every part, so you can build, experiment, and perfect your craziest ideas. Whether you're making something totally wacky or fine-tuning the ultimate machine, this is your space to play, test, and let your imagination run wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a challenge? Take on a series of fun, fast-paced missions that test your creativity and skills! Build awesome machines to tackle tricky terrain, blast enemies sky-high, and pull off crazy stunts like flying, sliding, and jumping through obstacles. Try to beat your own records, or go all out designing the ultimate battle machine to cause maximum destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/855047428d541471c5385ac60a0719e9.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/855047428d541471c5385ac60a0719e9.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/855047428d541471c5385ac60a0719e9.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of a brilliant engineer and construct one-of-a-kind machines to fulfill contracts and revive mining operations. Breathe new life into Cloud City\u2019s economy as you build awe-inspiring floating structures high above Venus\u2019s skies. Upgrade your gear, master new skills, and equip powerful tools and weapons to tackle any challenge. Explore both the soaring city and the planet\u2019s unforgiving surface in search of Vebrium\u2014the rare mineral that holds the key to your ultimate mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/570e735d2216cca874dd950fa1246ff7.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/570e735d2216cca874dd950fa1246ff7.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/570e735d2216cca874dd950fa1246ff7.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and build groundbreaking vehicles and machines like never before! Whether it soars through the skies, drifts across the ground, rolls into action, ramps up for epic jumps, or twists with precision, the possibilities are endless. Powered by a deeply satisfying physics system, you can fine-tune motors, tweak suspension, customize controls, and map every movement to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venus isn\u2019t just dangerous\u2014it\u2019s crawling with robot zombies, lying in wait, ready to power up at the first spark of electricity! Defend yourself with wild, physics-based gadgets like force fields, balloons, winches, and even gravity itself. Or, if you\u2019re feeling creative, build the ultimate battle machine and take the fight straight to them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful machines to crush towering rock formations and carve new pathways across the rugged terrain of Venus. Deploy cutting-edge mining technology to extract valuable minerals, then haul massive payloads across the alien landscape to their destination. Precision, strategy, and engineering mastery will be key to conquering the planet\u2019s challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the brutal landscape of Venus and bring abandoned outposts back to life! These high-tech stations hold powerful weather control systems that could change everything. Explore strange, otherworldly biomes and track down Vebrium\u2014a super rare mineral that\u2019s the key to your biggest mission yet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2640150?t=1756415292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/5be2abacf0e418044b3d73b6c796f638ab22c0f2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756415292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/4616ca6403491dddcac036e03965f9e0312dd530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756415292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/4616ca6403491dddcac036e03965f9e0312dd530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756415292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venus is a sandbox action-adventure that merges RPG progression with creative engineering, physics-based construction, and high-stakes exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the planet\u2019s dual nature\u2014a breathtaking, cloud-covered sky contrasted with its harsh and unforgiving surface\u2014the game delivers a rich, multi-layered experience. Venus invites you to design and construct innovative vehicles for mining and exploration, help shape a utopian city floating above the storm, and wield cutting-edge weaponry to face the relentless machine threat lurking below.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATIVE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No limits, no rules\u2014just pure creativity! In Creative Mode, you have access to every part, so you can build, experiment, and perfect your craziest ideas. Whether you're making something totally wacky or fine-tuning the ultimate machine, this is your space to play, test, and let your imagination run wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/7fe166b417f953d18782febd85b9a695.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHALLENGE MODE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for a challenge? Take on a series of fun, fast-paced missions that test your creativity and skills! Build awesome machines to tackle tricky terrain, blast enemies sky-high, and pull off crazy stunts like flying, sliding, and jumping through obstacles. Try to beat your own records, or go all out designing the ultimate battle machine to cause maximum destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/855047428d541471c5385ac60a0719e9.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/855047428d