ent to perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/62a428d86bb73a9f4a0c7884e883194f.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venus isn\u2019t just dangerous\u2014it\u2019s crawling with robot zombies, lying in wait, ready to power up at the first spark of electricity! Defend yourself with wild, physics-based gadgets like force fields, balloons, winches, and even gravity itself. Or, if you\u2019re feeling creative, build the ultimate battle machine and take the fight straight to them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/bacecdedbfe0070c2c1c0b51ed8b10f6.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command powerful machines to crush towering rock formations and carve new pathways across the rugged terrain of Venus. Deploy cutting-edge mining technology to extract valuable minerals, then haul massive payloads across the alien landscape to their destination. Precision, strategy, and engineering mastery will be key to conquering the planet\u2019s challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/0348b8df9f0067f458fc4c03d33abd49.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the brutal landscape of Venus and bring abandoned outposts back to life! These high-tech stations hold powerful weather control systems that could change everything. Explore strange, otherworldly biomes and track down Vebrium\u2014a super rare mineral that\u2019s the key to your biggest mission yet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.poster.avif?t=1756415292\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.webm?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640150/extras/9dcd1f9437219e8703eee788c61b09dd.mp4?t=1756415292\" type=\"video/mp4\